  <programme start="20260828220000 +0530" stop="20260828225500 +0530" channel="3444">
    <title>Naked and Afraid</title>
    <desc>Discovery Channel takes the ubiquitous survival show theme to the next level by stripping it to its bare essentials. In &quot;Naked and Afraid,&quot; complete strangers -- usually a man and a woman -- meet in a very unique way: They&apos;re stranded in a dangerous, desolate location, without food or water, and they&apos;re completely naked. Each episode follows the adventurers as they attempt to survive on their own with nothing but a personal item and the knowledge that the only prize is their pride and sense of accomplishment. Because there is no other choice, competitors quickly get to know one another -- and their surroundings -- and hope that their instincts, survival skills and intestinal fortitude serve them well.</desc>
    <category>Series</category>
  </programme>
  <programme start="20260828225500 +0530" stop="20260828235000 +0530" channel="3444">
