    <desc>From the outside, families seem like harmonious units in loving homes. But you don&apos;t necessarily know what secrets families are hiding from the outside world. This series, narrated by actress Brenda Strong, explores families hiding the most extreme of family secrets: murder. Each episode explores a death in a family, unravelling the motives of the family members, all of whom are potential suspects - and potential victims. Sibling rivalries, disputes over family businesses and infidelity are some of the factors that lead to the families&apos; ultimate betrayals.</desc>
    <category>Series</category>
  </programme>
  <programme start="20260831022600 +0530" stop="20260831031600 +0530" channel="3452">
    <title>Haunted Towns</title>
    <desc>Founded by a devout Christian after having a paranormal encounter, The Tennessee Wraith Chasers investigate the most haunted towns in the United States. The team employs courage, wits and technology to find the truth behind the mystery.</desc>
    <category>Series</category>
  </programme>
  <programme start="20260831031600 +0530" stop="20260831040600 +0530" channel="3452">
    <title>True Conviction</title>
    <desc>Anna-Sigga Nicolazzi examines cases through the eyes of a prosecutor and shares her insights into how the complex threads of a murder investigation come together in the courtroom.</desc>
    <category>Series</category>
